23:;      Yeah, so, uhhh, the bad news is that a computer can't understand text very well.  The good news is that it's pretty easy to make the text machine-readable: each line of ode below translates to somewhere between 1 and 15 bytes that the computer can understand perfectly - but we can only recognize as a collection of random numbers.
